1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:04,700
How long will it last, Woody?

2
00:00:05,931 --> 00:00:08,638
Do you really think Andy is gonna take you to college?

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,170
Andy's growing up,

4
00:00:17,098 --> 00:00:19,098
and there's nothing you can do about it.

5
00:00:20,701 --> 00:00:25,308
You never forget kids like Emily or Andy.

6
00:00:28,007 --> 00:00:30,000
But they forget you.

7
00:00:31,132 --> 00:00:32,264
and then they leave

8
00:00:34,022 --> 00:00:39,321
then somehow you find yourself after all those year sitting in a closet

9
00:00:39,321 --> 00:00:41,465
just feeling useless

10
00:00:42,264 --> 00:00:43,063
yeah

11
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,306
Tell me this Sheriff

12
00:00:46,306 --> 00:00:49,726
If your kid loves you so much

13
00:00:49,726 --> 00:00:51,726
why is he leaving?

14
00:00:53,506 --> 00:00:56,419
Somewhere in that pad of stuffing is a toy who taught me that life's

15
00:00:56,419 --> 00:00:59,103
only worth living if you're bein' loved by a kid.

16
00:01:00,172 --> 00:01:02,399
We'll be there for him , together

17
00:01:03,243 --> 00:01:04,243
You're right, Prospector.

18
00:01:04,243 --> 00:01:06,178
I can't stop Andy from growing up.

19
00:01:07,399 --> 00:01:08,892
But I wouldn't miss it for the world.

20
00:01:13,112 --> 00:01:14,732
We'll always be there for him.

21
00:01:15,506 --> 00:01:17,614
All that time you spent with Andy...

22
00:01:19,566 --> 00:01:21,846
riding a bike with him for the first time...

23
00:01:23,855 --> 00:01:26,336
comforting him when he skinned his knee...

24
00:01:28,834 --> 00:01:31,085
proudly watching him grow up.

25
00:01:33,525 --> 00:01:36,000
And then you got a second chance with Bonnie...

26
00:01:38,383 --> 00:01:40,797
Was it as wonderful as it sounds?

27
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,076
It was.

28
00:01:44,569 --> 00:01:46,389
For infinity and beyond.

